/**
 * Fixtures the browser-side reader is pinned to.
 *
 * `API_PROOFS_FIXTURE` is not hand-written: it is the literal output of
 * `buildProofs` / `hashProofs` in the API's utils/proposalStatus.js, run over
 * the vote list below. That is the whole point of it - the leaf format has to
 * be byte-identical on both sides, and a fixture we invented ourselves would
 * only prove our own implementation agrees with itself. Regenerate it from the
 * API, never by copying what this repo produces.
 */

